### FilmFuse core-api - saved groups
# Token: see me.http. Use two accounts that are friends (social.http): @token owns the group,
# @otherToken (id @otherUserId) is invited. Non-members get 404 for every group route.

@baseUrl = http://localhost:8080
@token = paste-access-token-here
@otherToken = paste-second-access-token-here
@otherUserId = 00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000
@groupId = paste-group-id-here

### Create (201): you are OWNER; memberIds (0-19, your friends only) are INVITED
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/groups
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Roommates",
  "emoji": "🍿",
  "color": "#F5B942",
  "memberIds": ["{{otherUserId}}"]
}

### Someone who is not your friend -> 400
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/groups
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"name": "Strangers", "memberIds": ["11111111-1111-1111-1111-111111111111"]}

### My groups: ACTIVE ones by latest session, then pending invites
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/groups
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Detail: memberCount/invitedCount, members, comfort cap, effective filter (no attribution), recent sessions
# members (and memberPreview in the list) leave out anyone blocked either way with you; the counts don't.
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/groups/{{groupId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### The invitee can view it while INVITED
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/groups/{{groupId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{otherToken}}

### Accept the invite (as the invitee)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/groups/{{groupId}}/invites/accept
Authorization: Bearer {{otherToken}}

### ...or decline it (204; the invite row is removed)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/groups/{{groupId}}/invites/decline
Authorization: Bearer {{otherToken}}

### Owner edits: rename, recolour, and cap the group at PG with mild frights ("Kids" group)
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/groups/{{groupId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Kids",
  "color": "#C7354A",
  "comfortCap": {"maxCertification": "PG", "contentLimits": {"FRIGHTENING": "MILD"}}
}

### Remove the cap and the emoji (empty string clears; null / missing = unchanged)
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/groups/{{groupId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"emoji": "", "comfortCap": {"maxCertification": null, "contentLimits": {}}}

### Not the owner -> 403
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/groups/{{groupId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{otherToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"name": "Mine now"}

### Invite more of YOUR friends (any ACTIVE member; 409 beyond 20 people incl. invites)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/groups/{{groupId}}/members
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"userIds": ["{{otherUserId}}"]}

### Owner removes someone (204)
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/groups/{{groupId}}/members/{{otherUserId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Leave (remove yourself). An owner leaving hands over to the earliest-joined ACTIVE member;
### the last ACTIVE member leaving deletes the group.
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/groups/{{groupId}}/members/{{otherUserId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{otherToken}}

### Delete the group (owner, 204). Its sessions survive without a group.
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/groups/{{groupId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
